      "filename": "\"Rebecca's cell\" at Narberth - geograph.org.uk - 530506.jpg",
      "title": "File:\"Rebecca's cell\" at Narberth - geograph.org.uk - 530506.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/72/%22Rebecca%27s_cell%22_at_Narberth_-_geograph.org.uk_-_530506.jpg",
